- The bug is that the `light` prop is not passed to `<ListBox>` in `Dropdown.js`.
- The patch adds `light={light}` to the `<ListBox>` in `Dropdown.js`.
- No changes are needed in `MultiSelect.js` as it already passes the `light` prop.
